<title>BELGIUM: EU details cereals projections to 2005/06.</title>
<headline>EU details cereals projections to 2005/06.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union total cereals and wheat supply and demand are expected to develop as follows between 1996/97 and 2005/06, the European Commission's agriculture directorate general said in a working document released on Wednesday.</p>
<p>	     EU-15 total cereals balance ('000 tonnes)</p>
<p>			1996/97    1997/98    2000/01    2005/06</p>
<p>    Production    200,688    201,206    198,409    213,227</p>
<p>    Consumption   169,591    171,149    173,009    177,899</p>
<p>    Imports	   3,900	4,500	5,000	5,000</p>
<p>    Exports	  31,200     31,673     26,381     26,381</p>
<p>    Start Stocks   23,003     26,800     25,145     65,383</p>
<p>    End Stocks     26,800     29,685     29,164     79,330</p>
<p>-incl</p>
<p>     intvn stocks   5,200     10,671	8,403     57,983</p>
<p>	     EU-15 Wheat Balance ('000 tonnes)</p>
<p>    Production     98,000     99,669    104,169    115,637</p>
<p>    Consumption    80,800     82,826     85,084     90,830</p>
<p>    Imports	   1,400	1,900	1,900	1,900</p>
<p>    Exports	  18,500     19,521     15,938     15,938</p>
<p>    Start Stocks    9,094	9,194     15,245     45,640</p>
<p>    End Stocks	9,194	8,415     21,060     56,409</p>
<p>-incl</p>
<p>     intvn stocks     500	    0     10,653     45,509</p>
<p>--Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
